        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>30\" Ladder Door Pull with 18\" Center to Centers</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 30 Inch Round Ladder Pull is a wonderfully contemporary pull. Its sleek lines are in sync with the most popular decorating trends. It has 18 inch center to centers. Choose from satin nickel, polished chrome, or oil rubbed bronze finishes. This modern ladder door pull is available with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting--just make sure to order 2 pulls if you choose to mount your pulls back to back.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary door handle is made out of <b>3/4\" diameter</b> round tubing--that is the same diameter as a US penny! It has a 18\" center to center mounting (distance between the 2 mounting screws).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-45-specifications.gif?v=1704354669\" width=\"502\" height=\"130\" border=\"0\" alt=\"30 Inch Ladder Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n <a href=\"/products/10-inch-contemporary-pull\"><b>10\" Ladder Pull</b></a>, \r\n <a href=\"/products/12-inch-contemporary-pull\"><b>12\" Ladder Pull</b></a>, and\r\n <a href=\"/products/36-inch-ladder-door-pull-with-24-inch-center-to-centers-sgs-h3600\"><b>36\" Ladder Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the 30\" Contemporary Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Length: 18\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\" Ruund Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Point Diameter: 27/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-15/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "30 Inch Round Ladder Pull, SGS H3000",
                "description": "SGS H3000, 30 Inch Round Ladder Pull - The 30 Inch Round Ladder Pull is a wonderfully contemporary pull. Its sleek lines are in sync with the most popular decorating trends. It has 18 inch center to centers. Choose from satin nickel, polished chrome, or oil rubbed bronze finishes. This modern ladder door pull is available with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting--just make sure to order 2 pulls if you choose to mount your pulls back to back.",
